<section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Returns & Exchanges</span><h1>Returns and Exchanges</h1><p>Eligibility depends on product condition and order type, especially when custom dimensions or colors are produced.</p></div></section><section class="container section-space info-page"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="policy-card"><h2>Review Before Confirmation</h2><p>Confirm the product, dimensions, color, quantity and address before production begins.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="policy-card"><h2>Inspect on Delivery</h2><p>Review the product when received and report visible damage or differences as soon as possible.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="policy-card"><h2>Custom Orders</h2><p>Products made to special specifications require clear approval of details and terms before production.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="container info-alert"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i><div><h2>Contact Nestica for Case Review</h2><p>Send the order number, product photos and a description of the issue. The case is reviewed under the agreed order terms and applicable law.</p></div></section>
